Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.67,0:00:50.67,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}我就此深陷於你的維度之中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.14,0:00:53.34,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}消沉氣餒於我是多餘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.42,0:00:55.47,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}眼前則是俗套的情境
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.54,0:00:57.84,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}我們與彼此攜手作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.86,0:01:00.06,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}化學反應恰逢其時
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:02.72,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}抬起曾低下的頭
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.12,0:01:08.15,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}毒蛇在陰影之中襲擊了所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.63,0:01:11.77,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}甚至無暇顧及其他
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.87,0:01:13.47,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}但是你無法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.47,0:01:15.16,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}阻止這樣的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.76,0:01:17.41,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}承受致命一擊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.03,0:01:19.95,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}一旦有所猶豫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.31,0:01:22.58,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}懈怠與焦慮也將再次來襲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.58,0:01:24.25,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}阻止這樣的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.87,0:01:26.79,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}承受致命一擊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:29.09,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}得到釋放
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.65,0:01:30.33,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}必須奪回一切
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.45,0:01:31.38,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}必須奪回一切
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.62,0:01:31.84,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}喲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.84,0:01:33.68,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}這便是你之後
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.25,0:01:36.01,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}要傾聽的節奏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.42,0:01:38.35,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}這少年在之後
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.75,0:01:40.56,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}將傾聽這節奏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.03,0:01:42.77,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}再度來襲鏽跡斑駁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.22,0:01:45.10,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}冷熱交替 無休無止
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.58,0:01:47.32,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}要暗鬥到何時？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.83,0:01:50.48,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}輸掉決定性一擊 伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.73,0:01:52.45,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}但是你無法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.46,0:01:54.09,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}阻止這樣的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.76,0:01:56.44,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}承受致命一擊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.07,0:01:58.86,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}難以抑制的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.25,0:02:01.60,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}熱血與孤獨淪為一片漆黑
