Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.86,0:02:05.53,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\c&H272727&\1a&H00&\3c&HFEFEFE&\3a&H00&\bord1}承受致命一擊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.14,0:02:07.79,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\c&H272727&\1a&H00&\3c&HFEFEFE&\3a&H00&\bord1}不論多少次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.40,0:02:09.25,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\c&H272727&\1a&H00&\3c&HFEFEFE&\3a&H00&\bord1}必須奪回一切
